    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikengila Joamor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tekin Adonizedek kere ma Yerusalem owinjo paka Yosuwa oyido otieko mako Ay, aka oyido otieko reyo kicutho, ka timo ri Ay kodi kere mere paka oyido otieko timo ri Yeriko kodi kere mere, kodi paka jopiny ma Gibeon oyido jotieko timo siem gi Isiraili aka oyido jonitie i dier jo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lworo omako jo tektek, rupiri Gibeon oyido obedo tindi madwoŋ swa, paka acel kwoŋ tindin pa kere, aka kwoŋbedo oyido dwoŋ loyo Ay, aka cwo mere je oyido jomeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to Adonizedek kere ma Yerusalem dhiro ri Hoham kere ma Hebron, ri Piram kere ma Yarmuth, ri Yafia kere ma Lakis, kodi ri Debir kere ma Egilon, ka waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Biye win malo bongan wikonyan, aka wamonji Gibeon; rupiri otieko timo siem gi Yosuwa kodi Joisiraili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to kerin abic apa Joamor, kere ma Yerusalem, kere ma Hebron, kere ma Yarmuth, kere ma Lakis, kodi kere ma Egilon, jocoko jolweny pajo, to jokidho malo gi jolweny pajo je to joketho kambi pajo kwoŋ Gibeon, to jotimo lweny kwoŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka cwo ma Gibeon jodhiro ri Yosuwa wac i kambi i Gilgal, ka jowaco ni, “Ikir'ilwogi cingin kwoŋ ŋecin perin, biye bongi wan piyo, aka ibothi wan, aka ikony wan; kole kerin je mapa Joamor ma jobedo i piny matendere jocokere kwoŋ wan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to Yosuwa idho malo wok Gilgal, go kodi ji je ma lweny gi go, kodi cwo ma jomeni je ma jocwiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth waco ri Yosuwa ni, “Ikir'ilwor jo, rupiri atieko ketho jo i cingin; ongoye kada ŋat'acel ma lacungo i waŋin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to Yosuwa podho kwoŋ jo abwap, kareno otieko ŋanjo kidho malo wor je wok Gilgal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth bolo jo i kirin ruwaŋ Isiraili, to neko jo gi yaŋ madwoŋ i Gibeon, to riemo jo i royo ma loro ma Bethhoron, to rwadho jo piny tundo kiri Azeka kodi Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo oyido joringo ruwaŋ Isiraili, munyo oyido joloro piny i kamaloro ma Bethhoron, to Rwoth dwiro piny telin madongo wok i polo kwoŋ jo tundo kiri Azeka, to jotho; nitie megi m'oromo ma jotho ro pe loyo ji meno ma Isiraili m'oneki jo g'abor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to Yosuwa luwo gi Rwoth i ndelo ma Rwoth omiy'iye Joamor ri cwo ma Isiraili; to waco ruwaŋ Isiraili ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to Yosuwa gik, kodi Isiraili je gi go, i kambi ma Gilgal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa mako Kerin abic ma Amor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerin abic me to joringo, to jopondo i ŋungu i Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "T'iwaco ri Yosuwa ni, “Onwaŋ kerin abic, jopondo i ŋungu i Makeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa to waco ni, “Ŋili win woko telin madongo i dhok ŋungu, aka wikethi cwo cegin gine ma kuro jo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to wikiri wibedi kenyo wiwegi ka witieko riemo jokwor mewin, wimonji jo gi yucen pajo, aka wikiri wiyey jowodonji i tindin madongo pajo; rupiri Rwoth Were mewin otieko ketho jo i cingi win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yosuwa kodi Joisiraili jotieko cowo neko jo gi yaŋ madwoŋ, cuka orey jo woko, aka munyo ji ma joboth kwoŋ jo jodonjo i tindin madongo m'otinda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ji je jogik i siem bongi Yosuwa i kambi i Makeda; aka ongoye dhano kad'acel m'obidho lewe kwoŋ dhano moro je kwoŋ Joisiraili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yosuwa waco ni, “Yaw win dhok ŋungu, aka wikel woko kerin abic no bongan wok i ŋungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jotimo ameno, jowodho woko to jotero kerin abic no bongi Yosuwa wok i ŋungu, kere ma Yerusalem, kere ma Hebron, kere ma Yarmuth, kere ma Lakis kodi kere ma Egilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo jowodho woko kerin no bongi Yosuwa, Yosuwa to lwoŋo cwo je ma Isiraili, to waco ri jomituka pa cwo ma lweny m'oyido jokadho gine ni, “Core win cegin, kethi win tiendi win i ŋuti kerin me.” To jocore cegin, to joketho tiendi gin i ŋuti jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa to waco rijo ni, “Wikiri wibedi malwor kosa wibwoki; bedi win matek kodi jomiseni; kole Rwoth latimo ameno ri jokwor mewin je ma wigore gi jo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka rumacen to Yosuwa rwadho jo piny, to neko jo, to liero jo i win abic. To joliero i wi yen tundo othieno; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to munyo waŋceŋ podho, Yosuwa owodho or, to jokwanyo jo piny wok i yen, to jobolo jo i ŋungu kam'oyido jopond'iye, to jojengo telin madongo i dhok ŋungu, ma fodi nitie kenyo kiri pama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa mako adec pa Joamor man",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa to mako Makeda i ndelo no, to rwadho piny gi kere mere gi lew abor mabith; oreyo woko kicutho kisi dhano manitie iye, k'oweyo ŋatimoro; to timo ri kere ma Makeda paka oyido otieko timo ri kere ma Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
